              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 8:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.15+DEU.27.16+DEU.27.17+DEU.27.18+DEU.27.19+DEU.27.20+DEU.27.21+DEU.27.22+DEU.27.23+DEU.27.24+DEU.27.25+DEU.27.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 27:15-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naam, Israeli wote wameihalifu sheria yako, kwa kugeuka upande, wasiisikilize sauti yako; basi kwa hiyo laana imemwagwa juu yetu, na uapo ule ulioandikwa katika sheria ya Musa, mtumishi wa Mungu; kwa sababu tumemtenda dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LAM.2.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Omb 2:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 5:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ameyathibitisha maneno yake, aliyoyanena juu yetu, na juu ya waamuzi wetu waliotuamua, kwa kumletea mambo maovu makuu; maana chini ya mbingu zote halikutendeka jambo kama hili, lilivyotendeka juu ya Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama ilivyoandikwa katika sheria ya Musa, mabaya haya yote yametupata lakini hata hivyo hatukumwomba BWANA, Mungu wetu, atupe fadhili zake, ili tugeuke na kuyaacha maovu yetu, na kuitambua kweli yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi BWANA ameyavizia mabaya hayo, akatuletea; maana BWANA, Mungu wetu ni mwenye haki katika kazi zake zote azitendazo; na sisi hatukuitii sauti yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na sasa, Ee Bwana Mungu wetu, uliyewatoa watu wako hawa katika nchi ya Misri kwa mkono hodari, ukajipatia sifa, kama ilivyo leo; tumefanya dhambi, tumetenda maovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Bwana sawasawa na haki yako yote, nakusihi, hasira yako na ghadhabu yako zigeuzwe na kuuacha mji wako Yerusalemu, mlima wako mtakatifu; maana kwa sababu ya dhambi zetu, na maovu ya baba zetu, Yerusalemu na watu wako wamepata kulaumiwa na watu wote wanaotuzunguka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sasa, Ee Mungu wetu, yasikilize maombi ya mtumishi wako, na dua zake, ukaangazishe uso wako juu ya patakatifu pako palipo ukiwa, kwa ajili ya Bwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mungu wangu, tega sikio lako, ukasikie; fumbua macho yako ukautazame ukiwa wetu, na mji ule ulioitwa kwa jina lako; maana hatukutolei maombi yetu kwa sababu ya haki yetu, lakini kwa sababu ya rehema zako nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Bwana, usikie; Ee Bwana, usamehe; Ee Bwana, usikilize, ukatende, usikawie; kwa ajili yako wewe, Ee Mungu wangu; kwa sababu mji wako na watu wako wanaitwa kwa jina lako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
